<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=1200, initial-scale=0.3">
    <title>Estate Spark | Global Digital Mandates & Asset Store</title>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;600;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <script src="https://cdn.paddle.com/paddle/v2/paddle.js"></script>
    <style>
        :root {
            --gold: #c5a059;
            --navy: #0a1128;
            --slate: #4a4a4a;
            --border: #e0e0e0;
            --white: #ffffff;
            --bg: #f8f9fa;
        }

        * { box-sizing: border-box; }
        body { font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif; margin: 0; background: var(--bg); color: var(--navy); line-height: 1.7; }
        .container { width: 1140px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 20px; }

        /* --- NAVIGATION --- */
        nav { background: var(--white); padding: 25px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); position: sticky; top: 0; z-index: 9999; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; }
        .logo { font-weight: 800; font-size: 22px; letter-spacing: -1px; text-decoration: none; color: var(--navy); }
        .nav-links a { text-decoration: none; color: var(--navy); margin-left: 35px; font-weight: 600; font-size: 13px; text-transform: uppercase; }

        /* --- HERO --- */
        .hero { padding: 120px 0; background: var(--navy); color: var(--white); text-align: center; border-bottom: 5px solid var(--gold); }
        .hero h1 { font-size: 58px; margin: 0 0 20px; letter-spacing: -3px; font-weight: 800; }
        .hero p { font-size: 22px; opacity: 0.8; max-width: 800px; margin: 0 auto; font-weight: 300; }

        /* --- TRUST BAR --- */
        .trust-bar { background: #fff; padding: 20px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); text-align: center; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--gold); letter-spacing: 2px; text-transform: uppercase; }

        /* --- PRODUCTS GRID --- */
        .section-header { margin: 100px 0 50px; text-align: center; }
        .section-header h2 { font-size: 36px; font-weight: 800; margin-bottom: 10px; }
        .section-header p { color: var(--slate); font-size: 16px; }

        .product-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 30px; margin-bottom: 100px; }
        .product-card { background: var(--white); border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 4px; padding: 40px; transition: all 0.4s; position: relative; overflow: hidden; }
        .product-card:hover { border-color: var(--gold); transform: translateY(-5px); box-shadow: 0 30px 60px rgba(0,0,0,0.05); }
        .product-card .tag { position: absolute; top: 20px; right: 20px; font-size: 10px; font-weight: 800; background: var(--bg); padding: 5px 10px; border-radius: 20px; }
        .product-card h3 { font-size: 22px; margin: 0 0 15px; }
        .product-card .price { font-size: 32px; font-weight: 800; margin-bottom: 20px; display: block; }
        .product-card p { font-size: 14px; color: var(--slate); margin-bottom: 30px; min-height: 80px; }
        
        .buy-btn { width: 100%; padding: 18px; background: var(--navy); color: var(--white); border: none; font-weight: 700; cursor: pointer; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 1px; transition: background 0.3s; }
        .buy-btn:hover { background: var(--gold); }

        /* --- LEGAL BLOCKS (The Compliance Engine) --- */
        .legal-section { background: var(--white); padding: 80px 0; border-top: 1px solid var(--border); }
        .legal-box { border: 1px solid var(--border); padding: 40px; margin-bottom: 30px; border-radius: 8px; }
        .legal-box h4 { margin-top: 0; text-transform: uppercase; font-size: 14px; color: var(--gold); }
        .legal-box p, .legal-box li { font-size: 13px; color: var(--slate); }

        /* --- FOOTER --- */
        footer { padding: 60px 0; background: var(--bg); border-top: 1px solid var(--border); font-size: 12px; }
        .footer-flex { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; }
        .mor-badge { background: #f0f0f0; padding: 25px; border-radius: 5px; max-width: 600px; }

    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <nav>
        <div class="container" style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; width: 100%; align-items: center;">
            <a href="#" class="logo">ESTATE SPARK</a>
            <div class="nav-links">
                <a href="#digital-assets">Digital Assets</a>
                <a href="#professional-services">Services</a>
                <a href="#compliance">Compliance</a>
                <a href="mailto:awais@estatespark.co.uk">Contact</a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </nav>

    <section class="hero">
        <div class="container">
            <h1>Strategic Digital Solutions</h1>
            <p>High-fidelity web assistance, institutional content, and online growth mandates for international principals and UK agencies.</p>
        </div>
    </section>

    <div class="trust-bar">Verified Merchant of Record Flow • Secure Checkout via Paddle • UK-Compliance Standard</div>

    <div class="container" id="digital-assets">
        <div class="section-header">
            <h2>Institutional Asset Library</h2>
            <p>Instant-access digital kits engineered for career and business velocity.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="product-grid">
            <div class="product-card">
                <span class="tag">E-BOOK / PDF</span>
                <h3>Resume Alpha Kit</h3>
                <span class="price">£3.99</span>
                <p>Metric-based resume templates, AI prompt libraries, and performance-verb cheat sheets. Instant digital download upon purchase.</p>
                <button class="buy-btn paddle_button" data-product="YOUR_ID_1">Download Asset</button>
            </div>
            <div class="product-card">
                <span class="tag">SCRIPTS</span>
                <h3>B2B Outreach Vault</h3>
                <span class="price">£12.50</span>
                <p>High-conversion video and email scripts designed for UK real estate and logistics prospecting. Delivered via secure email link.</p>
                <button class="buy-btn paddle_button" data-product="YOUR_ID_2">Secure Access</button>
            </div>
            <div class="product-card">
                <span class="tag">GUIDE</span>
                <h3>Digital Growth Map</h3>
                <span class="price">£25.00</span>
                <p>A masterclass in remote agency operations and digital footprint optimization. Comprehensive PDF format.</p>
                <button class="buy-btn paddle_button" data-product="YOUR_ID_3">Acquire Guide</button>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="container" id="professional-services" style="background: #fff; padding: 60px 20px; border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 100px;">
        <div class="section-header">
            <h2>Remote Freelance Mandates</h2>
            <p>Direct professional assistance for website management and business operations.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="product-grid">
            <div class="product-card">
                <h3>Technical Web Audit</h3>
                <span class="price">£150.00</span>
                <p>Full forensic audit of your website's performance, SEO, and conversion logic. Delivered as a recorded video mandate.</p>
                <button class="buy-btn paddle_button" data-product="YOUR_ID_4">Order Audit</button>
            </div>
            <div class="product-card">
                <h3>GitHub Pages Deploy</h3>
                <span class="price">£290.00</span>
                <p>Professional deployment of your custom mandate site on GitHub Pages with SSL and custom domain configuration.</p>
                <button class="buy-btn paddle_button" data-product="YOUR_ID_5">Initiate Setup</button>
            </div>
            <div class="product-card">
                <h3>Monthly Ops Support</h3>
                <span class="price">£450.00</span>
                <p>A retainer-based service for ongoing digital assistance, content management, and remote admin support.</p>
                <button class="buy-btn paddle_button" data-product="YOUR_ID_6">Start Retainer</button>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <section class="legal-section" id="compliance">
        <div class="container">
            <div class="section-header">
                <h2>Legal & Operational Infrastructure</h2>
                <p>Transparent policies as required by our global payment processor, Paddle.com.</p>
            </div>
            
            <div class="legal-box">
                <h4>1. Terms of Service</h4>
                <p>By engaging with Estate Spark, you acknowledge that all services are delivered remotely. Digital products are defined as non-tangible, irrevocable goods. We do not guarantee specific financial outcomes but guarantee the professional delivery of all technical specifications. All contracts are governed by the jurisdiction of our operational base in Pakistan while adhering to UK consumer standards for digital delivery.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="legal-box">
                <h4>2. Refund & Cancellation Policy</h4>
                <ul>
                    <li><strong>Digital Products:</strong> Due to the nature of instant downloads, refunds are not issued once the file has been accessed or downloaded.</li>
                    <li><strong>Services:</strong> Service mandates may be cancelled within 24 hours of purchase for a full refund. Once the technical audit or web assistance project has commenced, refunds are prorated based on work completed.</li>
                    <li><strong>Requests:</strong> All refund requests must be sent to awais@estatespark.co.uk within 7 days of the transaction.</li>
                </ul>
            </div>

            <div class="legal-box">
                <h4>3. Delivery Policy</h4>
                <p>Digital products are delivered instantly via the checkout success page and a secondary email link. Freelance service mandates are initiated within 48 hours of payment. Technical audits are typically delivered within 5 business days via secure Loom video or PDF report.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <footer>
        <div class="container">
            <div class="footer-flex">
                <div class="mor-badge">
                    <strong>Merchant of Record Disclosure</strong><br><br>
                    Our order process is conducted by our online reseller Paddle.com. Paddle.com is the Merchant of Record for all our orders. Paddle handles all customer service inquiries and returns. Your personal data will be shared with Paddle for payment processing. 
                    <br><br>
                    <strong>Billing Descriptor:</strong> PADDLE.NET * ESTATE SPARK
                </div>
                <div style="text-align: right;">
                    <strong>Operational Headquarters:</strong><br>
                    Estate Spark | Nasar Pur Area<br>
                    Peshawar, KP, Pakistan<br><br>
                    <strong>Communication:</strong><br>
                    awais@estatespark.co.uk<br>
                    WhatsApp Support Active
                </div>
            </div>
            <p style="margin-top: 40px; border-top: 1px solid #ddd; padding-top: 20px;">
                &copy; 2026 Estate Spark. All Rights Reserved. Professional Digital Mandates for International Clients.
            </p>
        </div>
    </footer>

    <script type="text/javascript">
        Paddle.Setup({ 
            vendor: YOUR_VENDOR_ID, // YOUR REAL PADDLE VENDOR ID
            eventCallback: function(data) {
                if (data.event === 'Checkout.Complete') {
                    window.location.href = "/thank-you.html";
                }
            }
        });
    </script>
</body>
</html>
